<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine monthly vegoil/subproduct shipments.</title>
<headline>Argentine monthly vegoil/subproduct shipments.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine Agriculture Secretariat July subproduct shipment figures, followed by January to July totals, in tonnes, (year-earlier in brackets):</p>
<p> Soymeal plts    777,655  (593,444)  4,216,705  (3,473,303)</p>
<p> Sunseed plts    199,031  (206,261)  1,290,665  (1,333,037)</p>
<p> Cotton plts	50,085   (18,144)    136,913    (121,165)</p>
<p> Linseed expls	 nil	(nil)     77,094     (61,410)</p>
<p> Groundnut plts    2,200   (24,097)     21,394     (18,396)</p>
<p> Other plt/expl   24,982   (29,252)    113,782    (149,161)</p>
<p> Soybean oil     182,144  (133,614)    824,515    (709,259)</p>
<p>    Sunoil     151,980     (94,012)   840,796     (850,044)</p>
<p>Principal destinations in July were as follows (tonnes):</p>
<p>SOYPELLETS: China 78,367; Holland 78,330; Iran 75,822; Denmark 65,939; Italy 97,325</p>
<p>SUNPELLETS: Holland 110,125; Egypt 17,661; United Kingdom 10,830; Denmark 10,487; Chile 10,262</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
</text>
